    "<div class=\"t-row\"><div class=\"t-cell\"><!--\n    =====================\n        Partials/DateMenu/News.html\n--><!--\n    =====================\n        Partials/DateMenu/MediaPreview.html\n--><div class=\"img-wrap\"><img title=\"Symrise motif for Mindera\u00ae\" alt=\"Symrise motif for Mindera\u00ae\" src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/1/d/csm_250320_Symrise_PR_CI_Mindera_32b2f602e3.jpg\" width=\"176\" height=\"162\"></div><p><b class=\"rounded-border\">\n                \n                    \n                            Scent &amp; Care |\n                        \n                \n                    \n                            Corporate\n                        \n                \n            </b><span class=\"news-date\">\n            March 21, 2025\n        </span></p><p><b>Symrise AG launches Mindera\u00ae platform, ushering in a new era of plant-based product protection</b></p><!-- teaser --><p class=\"news-detail\">\n        \n            \n                    \u2012\tMindera\u00ae technology sees launch of four, patent-protected, 100%-plant-based ingredients<br>\n\u2012\tHigh-performing natural products smartly combine to provide multifunctional protection in line with a clean beauty mindset<br>\n\u2012\tInnovative formulation and sustainability benefits broaden the formulator toolbox for product protection\n                \n        \n    </p><p><a class=\"read-more-gray-chevron\" title=\"Symrise AG launches Mindera\u00ae platform, ushering in a new era of plant-based product protection\" href=\"/newsroom/article/symrise-ag-launches-minderar-platform-ushering-in-a-new-era-of-plant-based-product-protection/\">\n            Read more\n        </a></p></div></div>",
